#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:1
#: d0df8e7394614867ae43f50ca27105ef
msgid "Isaac Sim"
msgstr "Isaac Sim"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:3
#: 771c0042355e4884869fcbece6dc769c
msgid ""
"Open a robot in NVIDIA Isaac Sim and drive it with the same ROS 2 stack "
"you use on the real machine."
msgstr "在 NVIDIA Isaac Sim 里打开一台机器人，用和真机同一套 ROS 2 运控把它驱动起来。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:5
#: cdc020d3dcbd432aabf177151aef8ce3
msgid ""
"FaSim-Isaac holds the assets and installs the OmniGraph extensions. Run "
"`./init.sh`, then `./run.sh` or `./run_headless.sh`. You choose the robot"
" by opening its USD. There is no `./run.sh --robot`. The Isaac path and "
"version are in `config/fa_sim.conf`, with a machine override in "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf`."
msgstr "FaSim-Isaac 存放资产，并安装 OmniGraph 扩展。先 `./init.sh`，再 `./run.sh` 或 `./run_headless.sh`。打开哪份 USD，就是选哪台机器人。没有 `./run.sh --robot`。Isaac 的路径和版本在 `config/fa_sim.conf`，单机覆盖写在 `config/fa_sim.local.conf`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:7
#: 1325ee78323d45148a8db3b95a693a05
msgid ""
"Connect ROS 2 in one of two ways. Use one of them for a given stage. "
"These are description hardware keys, not the FaSim Kit extensions."
msgstr "ROS 2 有两种接法。一个舞台用其中一种。它们是描述包里的硬件键，不是 FaSim Kit 扩展。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md
#: 83b556b21a3e44f5b7fd3f1e11d65d56
msgid "What you start"
msgstr "你启动的是什么"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md
#: 3e755e79bd6743d5bf7cfae0999ade91
msgid "Plugin"
msgstr "Plugin"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md
#: 01131b3b14d1418cadc1f52c4aec0140
msgid "What moves the joints"
msgstr "谁在驱动关节"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md
#: 66fd36da17d54af0b448773e1aa74ff1
msgid "`hardware:=isaac`"
msgstr "`hardware:=isaac`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md
#: 0a3d21fad20f46ed8d0ee16c696fb19f
msgid "`topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem`"
msgstr "`topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md
#: 648d2c6f878947ea8a1ae863ddff3fde
msgid "OmniGraph joint topics"
msgstr "OmniGraph 关节话题"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md
#: 665bad2beafd4fd3a2fd193a66170f1d
msgid "Play on an in-process `ROS2ControlLaunch`"
msgstr "在进程内的 `ROS2ControlLaunch` 上按 Play"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md
#: f88cd321496f4253bc9741251c7ee864
msgid ""
"`isaacsim_ros2_control/IsaacSimSystem` (`hardware=isaac_sim` inside the "
"node)"
msgstr "`isaacsim_ros2_control/IsaacSimSystem`（节点内部的 `hardware=isaac_sim`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md
#: 770eba541e614d7ab93d5122553d46a8
msgid "The controller manager inside the Isaac process"
msgstr "Isaac 进程里的控制器管理器"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:14
#: b6e5c6ca9f664813855c91a4df688a64
msgid ""
"`isaac_sim` is the hardware interface for that in-process controller. It "
"is not a second robot. A swerve chassis uses a different node, "
"`SwerveController`, which is not a hardware key. Mechanism, parameters, "
"and clock/TF: [FaSim-Isaac "
"reference](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md)."
msgstr "`isaac_sim` 是这套进程内控制器的驱动层，不是第二台机器人。舵轮底盘用的是另一个节点 `SwerveController`，它不是硬件键。机制、参数以及时钟/TF 见 [FaSim-Isaac 参考](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:16
#: f17ff3393e38408fa2d2bacad4dd17ba
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "开始之前"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:18
#: 4dd75e3914444b38881a4e3f582af7b5
msgid ""
"Isaac Sim is installed, the GPU driver matches it, and `ISAACSIM_DIR` "
"points at that install (`~/isaacsim` unless you set another path)."
msgstr "Isaac Sim 已安装，显卡驱动与之匹配，`ISAACSIM_DIR` 指向这次安装（除非你另设路径，否则是 `~/isaacsim`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:19
#: cffa4848c1904caea2033d36c6930181
msgid ""
"A ROS 2 Jazzy workspace already builds this robot: `open-deploy-ws`, or "
"[fa-deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-deploy-ws) once you can"
" open that repository."
msgstr ""
"一个已经能编译这台机器人的 ROS 2 Jazzy 工作区：`open-deploy-ws`，或者你能打开的 [fa-deploy-"
"ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-deploy-ws)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:20
#: 9dd4f1b8710e40d18c15ae67c540abf2
msgid ""
"The topic bridge needs `topic_based_ros2_control` in that workspace. The "
"in-process graph and a swerve graph both need `./init.sh` operation 5 "
"(the FaSim extensions) and a restart of Isaac. The in-process path also "
"needs a description xacro that accepts `hardware` `isaac_sim`."
msgstr ""
"话题桥需要工作区里有 `topic_based_ros2_control`。进程内的图需要 `./init.sh` 的第 5 项，它会把 "
"`fasim.ros2.nodes` 装进这次 Isaac，并且描述 xacro 要接受 `hardware` 取值 `isaac_sim`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:24
#: 19cd1e43d12b400a8621da0db7e873d7
msgid "Start FaSim"
msgstr "启动 FaSim"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:26
#: 8657b09848ad43f4be28893c583d16ae
msgid ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh\n"
"./run.sh"
msgstr ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh\n"
"./run.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:33
#: f6ef8468f94e486185f7fb53fe3b41c2
msgid ""
"`./init.sh` asks you to ([README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/README.md)):"
msgstr ""
"`./init.sh` 会请你做这些事（[README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/README.md)）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:35
#: 9f3f25bd01564b0ca19b1b7abcca1f7d
msgid ""
"Check out the submodules you select (`.gitmodules` and "
"`submodules_visibility.conf`). Public entries start checked. Private "
"entries, including [fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-"
"project-usd) and [labutopia-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/labutopia-usd), stay unchecked until you can open them. A later run only"
" adds what you check. Current public versus private rows: "
"[robot_usds](../../4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md) and "
"[Environment assets](../../4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md)."
msgstr "检出你勾选的子模块（`.gitmodules` 和 `submodules_visibility.conf`）。公开项默认勾上。私有项，包括 [fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) 和 [labutopia-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/labutopia-usd)，在你能打开之前保持不勾。以后再跑只会补上新勾的项。当前公开与私有行见 [robot_usds](../../4-reference/simulation/3-robot_usds.md) 和 [环境资产](../../4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:36
#: 1d38a2ad194c4102ae9a8129dc948f07
msgid ""
"Update submodules you already checked out (`./init.sh --update`). This "
"does not pull the FaSim repository itself."
msgstr "更新已经检出的子模块（`./init.sh --update`）。这一步不会拉取 FaSim 仓库本身。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:37
#: fb8f0c9d116540298b712b7a0dae7428
msgid "Download ArtVIP into `environment/ArtVIP/` (`tools/artvip_kitchen.py`)."
msgstr "把 ArtVIP 下载到 `environment/ArtVIP/`（`tools/artvip_kitchen.py`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:38
#: 7f4942b752b5423a93349a5cb87da0f8
msgid ""
"Optionally add an Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy overlay under `isaac_jazzy_ws/`. The "
"menu asks GitHub for stable tags. If that query fails, "
"`config/fa_sim.conf` falls back to `6.2.0`, `6.1.0`, and `6.0.1`. "
"Override with `ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh`."
msgstr ""
"可以在 `isaac_jazzy_ws/` 下加一层 Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy 叠加。菜单会向 GitHub "
"查询稳定标签。查询失败时，`config/fa_sim.conf` 回退到 `6.2.0`、`6.1.0` 和 `6.0.1`。用 "
"`ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh` 覆盖。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:39
#: 9751e031a905494da56d8579b765a14f
msgid ""
"Install the FaSim extensions into this Isaac "
"(`exts/fasim.steering.nodes`, `exts/fasim.ros2.nodes`) and quiet the "
"script warnings. Run this again after you reinstall Isaac, then restart "
"Isaac so the extensions load. What each extension does: [FaSim Kit "
"extensions](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#fasim-kit-"
"extensions)."
msgstr "把 FaSim 扩展装进这次 Isaac（`exts/fasim.steering.nodes`、`exts/fasim.ros2.nodes`），并压低脚本警告。重装 Isaac 之后再做一次，然后重启 Isaac，扩展才会加载。各扩展做什么见 [FaSim Kit 扩展](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#fasim-kit-extensions)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:41
#: 166c1118071d499ab9d9057d68cc3db3
msgid ""
"`./run.sh` shows the saved backend, then asks PhysX or Newton, CPU "
"governor, and which ROS 2 workspace to source. `./run_headless.sh` is the"
" same menu for Headless Streaming. Non-interactive examples from the "
"README:"
msgstr ""
"`./run.sh` 先显示已保存的后端，再询问 PhysX 或 Newton、CPU 调速，以及要 source 哪个 ROS 2 "
"工作空间。`./run_headless.sh` 是无头串流的同一套菜单。README 里的非交互例子："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:43
#: 1305b82b8ed041a082cd59722a2e3451
msgid ""
"./run.sh -y --physics physx --cpu auto --ros-ws ~/ros2_ws\n"
"./run_headless.sh -y --physics physx --instance 0\n"
"./run.sh --asset-region china\n"
"./run.sh --kit-profile none"
msgstr ""
"./run.sh -y --physics physx --cpu auto --ros-ws ~/ros2_ws\n"
"./run_headless.sh -y --physics physx --instance 0\n"
"./run.sh --asset-region china\n"
"./run.sh --kit-profile none"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:50
#: ad30f2a8c39a4e958c64cade14b8c697
msgid ""
"`config/fa_sim.conf` kit profiles (`--kit-profile` / `--list-kit-"
"profiles`): `none`, `newton-physx-min`, `newton-physx`, `physx-compat`, "
"`physx-compat-full`. `--asset-region` is `none`, `us`, or `china`. Copy "
"`config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` to `config/fa_sim.local.conf` for a "
"machine override. When `RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp`, `./run.sh` "
"starts a Zenoh router and stops it on exit."
msgstr ""
"`config/fa_sim.conf` 的 kit 预设（`--kit-profile` / `--list-kit-"
"profiles`）：`none`、`newton-physx-min`、`newton-physx`、`physx-compat"
"`、`physx-compat-full`。`--asset-region` 为 `none`、`us` 或 `china`。把 "
"`config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` 复制成 `config/fa_sim.local.conf` "
"作为本机覆盖。当 `RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp` 时，`./run.sh` 会启动 Zenoh "
"路由，并在退出时停掉它。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:52
#: 2ba2f1f4a9144cbc9044e0e97f9ed63b
msgid ""
"Open the robot USD under `robots/` (robot_usds) or a scene under "
"`environment/`. Operation 5 must already be done before a stage that uses"
" `ROS2ControlLaunch` or `SwerveController`."
msgstr ""
"打开 `robots/`（robot_usds）下的机器人 USD，或 `environment/` 下的场景。使用 "
"`ROS2ControlLaunch` 的舞台，必须已经做过第 5 项。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:56
#: 7043633195954ad4bdeb99ed7550f7a7
msgid "Topic bridge (`hardware:=isaac`)"
msgstr "Topic bridge (`hardware:=isaac`)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:58
#: 670921c31b8e477aa61ea0921323b34e
msgid "In another terminal, after the workspace overlay:"
msgstr "另一个终端里，先 source 工作空间："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:60
#: 85f7310d2fb54a0cabfcbf98b990af49
msgid ""
"source ~/open-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone "
"hardware:=isaac"
msgstr ""
"source ~/open-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone "
"hardware:=isaac"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:65
#: a0c1cdde5b3347368e7b967db8083a0f
msgid ""
"`robot:=` is the description key (`<key>_description`). `demo.launch.py` "
"has no namespace argument. Do not append `namespace:=…` on this launch."
msgstr ""
"`robot:=` 是描述包键（`<key>_description`）。`demo.launch.py` "
"没有命名空间参数。这条启动命令上不要再加 `namespace:=…`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:67
#: 70dc6a6ec620496492d5644ceb38419e
msgid ""
"The shared macro [`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)"
" sets:"
msgstr ""
"共享宏 [`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)"
" 写成："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:69
#: 5e62bee3cee045478c4f0a5be10b548b
msgid "`joint_commands_topic` = `/isaac/joint_command`"
msgstr "`joint_commands_topic` = `/isaac/joint_command`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:70
#: 6020bf51a1f44782822d15950205f8a6
msgid "`joint_states_topic` = `/isaac/joint_states`"
msgstr "`joint_states_topic` = `/isaac/joint_states`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:72
#: 1c2ad96957c648c6a3f3fa86e3a02121
msgid ""
"Those strings have to match the OmniGraph `topicName` on this robot. W2’s"
" topic-bridge payload [`W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda) publishes `/joint_command` and "
"`/joint_states` instead. If the two sides differ, change the xacro "
"`<param>` or the graph until `ros2 topic echo` shows the same "
"`sensor_msgs/JointState` names the controller is using. Plugin "
"parameters: "
"[topic_based_ros2_control](../../4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md)."
msgstr ""
"这些字符串必须和这台机器人上 OmniGraph 的 `topicName` 一致。W2 的话题桥载荷 "
"[`W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-"
"gen2-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda) 发布的是 "
"`/joint_command` 和 `/joint_states`。两边不一致时，改 xacro 的 `<param>` 或改图，直到 "
"`ros2 topic echo` 看到的 `sensor_msgs/JointState` 名字和控制器正在用的一致。插件参数见 "
"[topic_based_ros2_control](../../4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:74
#: b0cd4b8fe1df400e8ca1ae114461fbfe
msgid ""
"`use_sim_time` follows `hardware` (`isaac` → true) unless you pass "
"`use_sim_time:=true` or `false`."
msgstr ""
"`use_sim_time` 跟随 `hardware`（`isaac` 时为 true），除非你显式传入 "
"`use_sim_time:=true` 或 `false`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:76
#: 694432fb214f4dcf8a85d2d68e0e8f15
msgid "Check:"
msgstr "Check:"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:78
#: f50cdadc5f454fa390a4103a3447e7bc
msgid ""
"ros2 topic echo /isaac/joint_states --once\n"
"# or the topicName this USD actually publishes"
msgstr ""
"ros2 topic echo /isaac/joint_states --once\n"
"# or the topicName this USD actually publishes"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:83
#: 00ab23fcd5c142d99ac7e7f24ce47c18
msgid ""
"A joint command on the matching command topic moves the articulation. "
"There is no stack-wide `/target_pose`."
msgstr "匹配的指令话题上的关节指令会驱动关节体。整栈没有统一的 `/target_pose`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:87
#: 139ded0d25264f6d8d2dda6473540538
msgid "In-process hardware interface (`isaac_sim`)"
msgstr "进程内驱动层（`isaac_sim`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:89
#: 6e49323f211048dca9f4129d23ce393a
msgid ""
"Use this when the USD contains `fasim.ros2.nodes.ROS2ControlLaunch`. W2’s"
" in-process payload is "
"[`W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fiveages-gen2-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda). Press"
" Play. The node calls `emit_control`, which sets `hardware=isaac_sim`, "
"passes the ArticulationRoot as `isaac_prim_path`, and starts the "
"controller manager inside Isaac."
msgstr ""
"USD 里有 `fasim.ros2.nodes.ROS2ControlLaunch` 时用这条。W2 的进程内载荷是 "
"[`W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fiveages-gen2-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)。按 "
"Play。节点调用 `emit_control`，设置 `hardware=isaac_sim`，把 ArticulationRoot 传成 "
"`isaac_prim_path`，并在 Isaac 里启动控制器管理器。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:91
#: f80fa844ea8a4d369d6b829151285c54
msgid ""
"The description package still has to exist. Its ros2_control xacro "
"includes `simulation_hardware_plugin` for `isaac_sim` "
"([robot_common_launch README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/README.md)). Graph "
"inputs, CppAD cache, and `infoFile`: [ROS 2 Control "
"extension](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#ros-2-control-"
"extension). An empty `robot` reads the USD `Robot` variant. That "
"string is the description package stem."
msgstr "描述包仍然要有。它的 ros2_control xacro 要为 `isaac_sim` 包含 `simulation_hardware_plugin`（[robot_common_launch README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/README.md)）。图输入、CppAD 缓存和 `infoFile` 见 [ROS 2 Control 扩展](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#ros-2-control-extension)。`robot` 留空时读取 USD 的 `Robot` 变体。该字符串是描述包的词干。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:93
#: 04ac4c2a9c01494aa3a2352ca3b0f0f4
msgid "After Play, check:"
msgstr "Play 之后检查："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:95
#: 12206fa9a6fc4d69924d5aec284010d0
msgid ""
"ros2 control list_controllers\n"
"ros2 topic echo /joint_states --once\n"
"ros2 topic hz /clock"
msgstr ""
"ros2 control list_controllers\n"
"ros2 topic echo /joint_states --once\n"
"ros2 topic hz /clock"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:101
#: 971939b9c8a14920a81286c323a46a79
msgid ""
"`/joint_states` here is the controller’s `joint_state_broadcaster`, not "
"the topic-bridge pair. `/clock` should tick near the physics rate. Arm "
"degrees of freedom are not also bridged on `/isaac/joint_command`."
msgstr ""
"这里的 `/joint_states` 是控制器的 `joint_state_broadcaster`，不是话题桥那一对。`/clock` "
"应接近物理频率。手臂自由度不会再桥到 `/isaac/joint_command`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:103
#: 45cdfe422760406b854463de25a75cf2
msgid ""
"`namespace` on the graph (empty for one robot) is how a second "
"articulation gets `/<ns>/controller_manager`. It is not a "
"`demo.launch.py` argument. Frame ids stay `world`, `odom`, and "
"`base_link` / `base_footprint`. See "
"[TF](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#tf)."
msgstr "图上的 `namespace`（单机器人时为空）用来给第二台关节体分配 `/<ns>/controller_manager`。它不是 `demo.launch.py` 的参数。帧 id 仍是 `world`、`odom`，以及 `base_link` / `base_footprint`。见 [TF](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#tf)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:105
#: e9010f8ca2af4f3d8724037470a8b3d1
msgid ""
"Whole-body mode (`mode` `full_body`) loads `ocs2_wbc_controller`. That "
"package is already in the GitHub Release deb `ros-jazzy-arms-"
"ros2-control`. Choose `d` for arms in `./init_repo.sh`, or run "
"`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only arms`. Cloning [ocs2-wbc-"
"controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-controller) is how "
"you read or edit the source. To hold a mobile base, keep the "
"description’s `mobile_base_tcp` info and send `BASE_LOCK`. A `full_body` "
"graph whose `infoFile` points at a `fixed_base` info file has no virtual "
"chassis joint for that lock, and arm enable can stay in "
"`WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`."
msgstr ""
"全身模式（`mode` 为 `full_body`）会加载 `ocs2_wbc_controller`。这个包已经在 GitHub Release"
" 的 deb `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` 里。`./init_repo.sh` 给 arms 选 `d`，或运行 "
"`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only arms`。克隆 [ocs2-wbc-"
"controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-controller) "
"是为了读源码或改源码。要按住移动底盘，保留描述里的 `mobile_base_tcp` info，并发送 "
"`BASE_LOCK`。`full_body` 的图把 `infoFile` 指到一份 `fixed_base` info "
"时，没有这把锁能用的虚拟底盘关节，手臂使能会停在 `WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:107
#: b445797f786147978937da76afa8459a
msgid ""
"If the opened USD uses `SwerveController` (Linkhou S2 or Taku chassis "
"graphs), that is the [swerve "
"extension](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#swerve-extension), "
"not this hardware key. After Play, publish a `geometry_msgs/Twist` on the"
" graph’s subscribe topic and check that steer joints move in position and"
" wheel joints in velocity."
msgstr "如果打开的 USD 用了 `SwerveController`（Linkhou S2 或 Taku 底盘图），那是 [舵轮扩展](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#swerve-extension)，不是这个硬件键。Play 之后，往图的订阅话题发布 `geometry_msgs/Twist`，确认转向关节按位置运动、驱动关节按速度转动。"

