msgid "When it fails"
msgstr "打不开时"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:124
#: c28815e5dd5241f59e03f706a4034ddc
msgid ""
"**Isaac does not start.** `ISAACSIM_DIR` must contain the launchers named"
" in `config/fa_sim.conf` (`isaac-sim.sh`, `isaac-sim.newton.sh`, `isaac-"
"sim.streaming.sh`, `isaac-sim.newton.streaming.sh`). `nvidia-smi` shows a"
" GPU. Logs: `~/.nvidia-omniverse/logs/`."
msgstr ""
"**Isaac 起不来。** `ISAACSIM_DIR` 里要有 `config/fa_sim.conf` 点名的启动器（`isaac-"
"sim.sh`、`isaac-sim.newton.sh`、`isaac-sim.streaming.sh`、`isaac-"
"sim.newton.streaming.sh`）。`nvidia-smi` 能看到 GPU。日志在 `~/.nvidia-"
"omniverse/logs/`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:126
#: 40867fec332140c5ae3ee62f0bcc4fcc
msgid ""
"**Play starts, but no ROS 2 topics appear.** The domain id and "
"`RMW_IMPLEMENTATION` match the workspace you sourced. For the topic "
"bridge, the graph `topicName` matches the xacro. For the in-process "
"graph, operation 5 is installed and Isaac was restarted, and the stage’s "
"`ROS` variant is the fiveages payload rather than the topic-bridge "
"payload. For a swerve graph, the `SwerveController` node type must be "
"available (same operation 5 and restart)."
msgstr ""
"**Play 起来了，但没有 ROS 2 话题。** 域 ID 和 `RMW_IMPLEMENTATION` 要和你 source "
"的工作区一致。话题桥：图的 `topicName` 和 xacro 一致。进程内：第 5 项已安装，Isaac 已重启，场景里的 `ROS` "
"变体是 fiveages 载荷，而不是话题桥载荷。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:128
#: 4dfb1736fece4aef816667fe36766671
msgid ""
"**A motion finishes much too fast.** On the in-process payload, `/clock` "
"comes from the on-demand `ROS_Clock` graph (`OnPhysicsStep`). That is how"
" W2 `fiveages.usda` is already wired. The topic-bridge `ros2.usda` still "
"publishes the clock from `OnPlaybackTick`. Fix the clock before you edit "
"joint gains. The mechanism is on the [FaSim-Isaac "
"Clock](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md#clock) "
"section."
msgstr ""
"**动作结束得特别快。** 进程内载荷上，`/clock` 来自按物理步更新的 `ROS_Clock` 图（`OnPhysicsStep`）。W2"
" 的 `fiveages.usda` 已经是这样接的。话题桥的 `ros2.usda` 仍从 `OnPlaybackTick` "
"发布时钟。先改时钟，再考虑关节增益。机制见 [FaSim-Isaac "
"参考](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md)。"

